Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe Ken went with Aro Kunemon,\Nbut at least he had me to rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daemon showed up and that creepy Oikawa\Ndude was just going to hand Ken over to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I sprang into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't really need the help, but I was\Nglad when the others finally showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took him long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daemon could open digital\Nports anytime he wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Kari said we should send him to the\Ndark ocean instead of the Digital World.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken had to use the dark power\Nstill deep inside him to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.52,0:01:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,open the gate and banish Daemon\Nfrom the face of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:01:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call teamwork.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\fscx110\fscy110\pos(216,149)}BlackWarGreymon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\fscx115\fscy115\pos(401,367)}WarGreymon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.76,0:02:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black O 'Greymon time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,O 'Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're organizing and cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any cleaner in the place\Nwould be a soap factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've already\Norganized that drawer, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the paper cuts\Nto show for it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.58,0:02:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just need to find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get the bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm actually going to miss\Nthe office over the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always so nice and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, this is the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he gives me the willies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he was at work\Nuntil just a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But yesterday and today,\Nhe didn't show up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't even call in or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.63,0:02:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right\Nif we kept this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't do anything dangerous, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Huh? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I think that's exactly\Nwhat you're going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks just like an\Nordinary person. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why is he able to control\NArchnemon and Mummymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to shut him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mount Fuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world can be beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But soon I'll claim my true prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.30,0:03:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arukenemon, I believe that opens in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're through playing\Naround, it's time to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a classic case of mass\Nhallucination, plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buildings have been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obviously a government\Nconspiracy to cover up a UFO crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying, I mean, I'm just\Nsaying that the destruction is real,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a mass hallucination caused it to seem
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the destruction\Nwas caused by monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government got to you too, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only Digimon were this deluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world would fall at\Nour feet like a ripe little plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To them, Digimon and UFOs\Nare exactly the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just something they're\Nafraid to admit exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But think,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if there's such a commotion now, wait\Ntill all those dark spores begin to bloom.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.09,0:04:05.01,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,0)\4c&H000000&\fscx90\fscy90\pos(320,312)}Setagaya ward, Tokyo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that you're done with\Nyour homework for the whole winter break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it is. Crazy, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, he was just returned from that\Nwhole kidnapping incident last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because he's\Nsuch a smart little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the press is sure to show\Nup again to talk about the kidnapping,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we can get more attention\Nby telling them how smart he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he'll become a media darling\Njust like that Ken Ichijoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then we'll get on TV. You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then everyone will know we're\Nthe parents of a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insects.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.09,0:04:42.92,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,0)\pos(327,317)}Odaiba, Tokyo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the man, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gives me the willies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.38,0:04:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what\Neverybody says about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, didn't you need to be someplace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fill me in when I get back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now feel free to make yourselves at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Mom's done some\Ninvestigating of her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you know T.K.'s mom is\Na newspaper reporter? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And look. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it a grocery list?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Goofy, it's the names and\Naddresses of the kidnapped kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mom does good work, TK. Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to save them\Nall before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't allow those children to\Nbecome drawn into evil the way I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, all those kids are depending on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't mean to cause trouble,\Nbut just what is the plan anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and go\Nmeet with those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we act quickly, maybe we can\Nstop the dark spores from growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.46,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,0)\4c&H000000&\fscx75\fscy75\pos(323,308)}Bunkyo ward, Tokyo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Noriko girl should be\Nhome any time now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, isn't that her,\Nlike, right in front of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:05:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She kicked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess she is evil, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe it's not even\Nworth talking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Dark Spore\Nhas already taken hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to at least try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even like to fight Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will we do if we're\Nforced to fight other kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.32,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\4c&H000000&\fscx80\fscy80\pos(323,311)}Ayase, Adachi ward
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go away and don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, ma 'am, just listen for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, how do people get\Nany encyclopedias sold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys, I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault she got angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs some catnip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's try the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid little meaningless bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need to be squashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll throw in\Nsome oysters, broccoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a quart of buttermilk, and\Njust a dash of vinegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do people find this\Ncold, wet gunk pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it'll cause\Nany problems tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose anything's\Npossible, Arukenemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go put the snow chains on the tires. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're annoying me. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're annoying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that a shooting star?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're going to hate hearing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I really don't think\Nwe're going to be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remove the dark spores\Nfrom those kidnapped kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:08:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking that Oikawa is probably\Nthe only person that can extract them,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we may be able to use\Nthat to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably got something specific planned\Nand will come for them sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we watch them, we'll\Ncatch Owikawa. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can ask Tai and the\Nothers to help us out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you'd hoped we could\Nsave those kids before...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't need to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ever not get mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get\Nstarted on this plan, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps now I will finally\Nfind the answers I seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't my teddy bear mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you, you can't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you lazybones, wake up! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a visitor. Find out who.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Teddy bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Blackwar Greymon! Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, everybody's got their assignments\Nabout who they're supposed to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you stick close to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want Oikawa sneaking\Nin when we're not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While we're following those kids, Tai\Nand Kari are going to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all this destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any idea what caused it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai! Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to call you into the\Ndigital world like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're in real serious danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know who is up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twitch my tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when Aquilamon\Ngave up some of his
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power to help us fight\Nin the real world? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when Gennai gave that power to all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the defenses of the digital\Nworld were weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the balance thrown off here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's not much that can stand\Nin the way of Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we've got no choice\Nbut to try and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Mount Fuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because it is Mount Fuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that Black War\NGreymon is in the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what Qinglongmon told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew we had to call you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't have the\Nstrength to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon got more power from Azulonmon, but\Nthere wasn't enough power for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you're up to\Nfighting Black War Greymon, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he really, really wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go find him, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful with Black War Greymon,\Nbut you can't let him win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this time, we're ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to be defeated again, you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is the infamous\NBlack War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you hope to accomplish here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish to look upon\Nthe face of my creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've come all this way to see\Nwhat you've already seen then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you life from just\Nthe tiny hairs on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but who gave you life? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who is your creator, Mummymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made both of these Digimon\Nby turning my DNA into data.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you see, BlackwarGreymon, I am the\Ncreator you've been searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I am a product of the real\Nworld, not the digital one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I think you've gotten\Nwhat you came for, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all beginning to\Nmake sense to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been searching for\Nanswers in the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to find the\Nmeaning of my existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but have been able to find\Nnothing to ease my pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was created from you, just\Nlike Archnemon and Mummymon were.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a part of the real world,\Nforeign to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do not belong there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're done\Nphilosophizing, then goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I'm done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foreign objects must be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a foreign object. But you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You belong in neither the\Ndigital world nor the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You upset the balance of both.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's talking crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to, uh, take\Ncare of him for you, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A foreign object?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give you life and this\Nis how you repay me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.48,0:13:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weep! Weep! Weep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon, what's Digibomb? Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jumpkills, Digimon,\Ndigital monsters, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's going to be a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, stop him, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi armor energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, armor Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nefertimon, the angel of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you protect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because without Oikawa, we'll never\Nget the dark spores out of those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll stay in there forever\Nif we let you destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you should have stopped\Nhim, not attacked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about hurting Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sneak bandage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S .I .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better call the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what we talked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be working together. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terror destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:14:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta, down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to fight\Nwhen we can be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendship is weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting, struggle, that is my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't have to\Nbe that way. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there is no need for two\NWar Greymons in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either you go or I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never fear, the gang's all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Davis and Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They went ahead to cut off traffic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a detour, folks, nothing to see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, just a couple of big digital\Nmonsters threatening traffic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard what the big\Nmonster said, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought of something. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:16:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens if the military\Nbase gets involved in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Cody and the\Nothers can take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for your own good, soldier boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should drive. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's three-on-one out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's even the odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big bandage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi-ya! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terror destroyers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're heading toward the base!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but should we stop\Nthem or go after Oikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one's it gonna be, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it should be the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon, Mega Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Dramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we can still catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, you shall face your doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperium on all takes two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighter Form!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unhand me, or feel my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he so eager to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but if we fight\Nhere, at least no one will be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Positron Laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warden at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only chance is to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at the sale\Nprices on those jackets!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all these people\Naround, I can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, did we get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when we almost had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you could\Ndefeat me, even two on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I almost wish you\Nhad destroyed me completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're after?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean this whole time\Nwe've been chasing you around,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching you blow up\Neverything blow-up-able?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've just wanted to find\Nsomething to destroy you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have anything better\Nto do with your free time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life has no meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor, poor, pitiful me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all about self-pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.38,0:19:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Ken was the Digimon Emperor,\Nhe treated me like fish bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.26,0:19:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost started to believe\Nthe awful things he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but deep inside I had faith\Nthat someday the real Ken would
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come back to me I just kept\Ntrying to get through to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:20:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't give up and neither can you Even\Nif your life is all fighting and struggle,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it can still have meaning\NI've had to fight all my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I believed in what I was fighting\Nfor I think it's that belief,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not the fighting that has\Ngiven my life meaning Can
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you imagine the trouble Tai\Nwould get into without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all you've got in your life is lemons,\Nmake lemon pie Hey! I'm hungry! Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your life doesn't, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to be filled with a whole bunch of\Nincredibly amazing events to be special.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.44,0:20:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some of the best times\NI've had are just eating
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sleeping and hanging\Nout with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the thing is, we would all be your\Nfriends if you just gave us the chance to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.77,0:20:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never thought he could have\Nfriends, and now he has lots of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just need to lighten up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want some pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all so foreign to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must think on it. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thank you for your\Nadvice. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it is time to put\Naside my warrior ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:20:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have provided me few answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.14,0:21:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And maybe one day we\Ncould even be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so, Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.24,0:21:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, why is everything that I can get?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.16,0:22:03.21,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:22:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as soon as I am, I know because
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're hoping to go away, wherever\Nit goes. We're going via everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.21,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.22,0:22:17.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as ever, once.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.10,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no shadow of a shadow,\Nbut the tree is finally opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fate of his fate will\Nmake it to the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.98,0:22:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The red dragon is flying into the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.26,0:22:58.64,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\fscx110\fscy110\pos(266,265)}BlackWarGreymon's Seal
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the gate is open.

